		{"id":"present-rule","type":"text","text":"## PRESENT MEANS RESPONSIVE\n\nThese are the conditions that can become play: a drifting realm, failed routes, protected inaction, concealed borders, and living systems that can answer when the player crosses a boundary.","x":550,"y":880,"width":790,"height":240,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# WORLD THROUGH THREE AGES\n\nSort by **relationship to the present**, even when the exact date is unknown.\n\n[[World/History/00 Three Ages|Open the chronology note]]","x":-420,"y":-1080,"width":840,"height":300,"color":"#C84F3D"},
		{"id":"image-distant","type":"text","text":"## I. DISTANT PAST\n\nOPEN CONTINUITY\n\nContinuity is public; stewardship is ordinary civic life.","x":-1450,"y":-540,"width":800,"height":380,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"travelers","type":"file","file":"World/Cosmology/The Original Travelers.md","x":-1450,"y":-50,"width":370,"height":260,"color":"6"},
